E1. AVALANCHE EFFECT

Jumlah percobaan: 1000 (pesan acak 32 byte, seed=2026)

  Fungsi       Rata-rata   Std dev     Min    Maks
  SHA-256          49.9%      3.2%   39.8%   62.5%
  hash_lemah        6.5%      4.6%    3.1%   31.2%

Idealnya rata-rata mendekati 50%.


